<title>BULGARIA: Bulgaria reaches $650 mln deal with IMF.</title>
<headline>Bulgaria reaches $650 mln deal with IMF.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bulgaria's interim government on Monday agreed a new $650 million accord with the International Monetary Fund, an IMF official said.</p>
<p>IMF mission head Anne McGuirk told a news conference $500 would be a standby accord and the other $150 million would finance cereal imports.</p>
</text>
